# Example CODEOWNERS for a harness project (2 engineers + 1 Tech Lead).
# Copy the lines you need into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @your-org/tech-lead.
#
# The Tech Lead owns the rules agents follow and the sensors that check them.
# Engineers own product code and their slices' specs, features, and sessions.

# Guides: steering and project bindings
/.harness/steering/                 @your-org/tech-lead
/AGENTS.md                          @your-org/tech-lead

# Sensors: invariants, drift, audit (asdd itself is the asdd-harness-kit package, pinned in package.json)
/.harness/config/project.json       @your-org/tech-lead
/.cursor/hooks.json                 @your-org/tech-lead
/.claude/settings.json              @your-org/tech-lead
/.agents/mcp/                       @your-org/tech-lead

# TL triage of audit findings
/.harness/audits/triage.json        @your-org/tech-lead

# CI gates
/.github/workflows/                 @your-org/tech-lead
